# ralph egress policy -- deny by default.
#
# One extended regular expression per line, matched against the destination
# hostname. Anchor with ^...$ so that a rule for `github.com` cannot be matched
# by `github.com.attacker.example`.
#
# Edit with `ralph policy edit`, inspect with `ralph policy ls`.
# Keep this list as small as your work allows.

# --- Agent API and authentication (required) ---
^api\.anthropic\.com$
^console\.anthropic\.com$
^claude\.ai$
^statsig\.anthropic\.com$

# --- Package registries ---
^registry\.npmjs\.org$
^pypi\.org$
^files\.pythonhosted\.org$

# --- Source hosting ---
^github\.com$
^api\.github\.com$
^codeload\.github\.com$
^objects\.githubusercontent\.com$
^raw\.githubusercontent\.com$

# --- OS packages (needed to install things inside the sandbox) ---
^archive\.ubuntu\.com$
^security\.ubuntu\.com$
^ports\.ubuntu\.com$
^deb\.nodesource\.com$
